<codeline><highlight class="normal">[//]:<sp/>#<sp/>&quot;Short<sp/>Description:<sp/>This<sp/>example<sp/>shows<sp/>a<sp/>simple<sp/>implementation<sp/>of<sp/>3-phase<sp/>motor<sp/>control<sp/>using<sp/>the<sp/>DRV8329<sp/>gate<sp/>driver<sp/>and<sp/>MCPWM<sp/>module.&quot;</highlight></codeline>
